WEBVTT

00:36:57.707 --> 00:37:01.396
where you can have a stack
of money, 100s, 50, whatever,

00:37:01.420 --> 00:37:06.016
a stack of money, gold bars --
nobody will touch it.

00:37:06.040 --> 00:37:10.635
But if you have creamer, cookies, cake ...

00:37:10.659 --> 00:37:13.944
So yeah, the kitchen table's
like your house, it's a dropping zone,

00:37:13.968 --> 00:37:16.102
everybody comes in,
just drops their stuff,

00:37:16.126 --> 00:37:20.903
whether it's mentally
or emotionally or just stuff, you know?

00:37:20.927 --> 00:37:24.736
Yeah, this is the nerve center right here.

00:37:24.760 --> 00:37:26.024
AG: Dan and his crewmates

00:37:26.048 --> 00:37:28.876
are just back from a call
at a residential building nearby.

00:37:28.900 --> 00:37:31.876
With their suits halfway on
and radios strapped to their chest,